sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Cluster Admin
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Reconciler as MCPLifecycleOperator<br/>Reconciler
    participant EmbeddedFS as Embedded Manifest<br/>Filesystem
    participant PlatformUtils as odh-platform-utilities<br/>Deployer (SSA)
    participant ConfigMap as Platform ConfigMap
    participant Cluster as Cluster Resources

    Note over User,Cluster: Reconciliation Trigger Flow

    User->>K8sAPI: Create/Update MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>(cluster-scoped)
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Watch event (For primary)
    activate Reconciler

    Note over Reconciler: Also triggered by:<br/>- Owned resource changes (label-scoped)<br/>- APIServer changes (OpenShift TLS)

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Get MCPLifecycleOperator CR
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: CR spec + status

    Note over Reconciler,ConfigMap: Platform Version Detection

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Read Platform ConfigMap
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Platform version info

    Note over Reconciler,EmbeddedFS: Manifest Rendering

    Reconciler->>EmbeddedFS: Read embedded manifests
    EmbeddedFS-->>Reconciler: Raw YAML manifests<br/>(CRD, Deployment, RBAC,<br/>Service, ServiceMonitor)

    Reconciler->>PlatformUtils: Render via Kustomize provider<br/>(apply image overrides via<br/>RELATED_IMAGE_ODH_MCP_LIFECYCLE_OPERATOR_IMAGE)
    PlatformUtils-->>Reconciler: Rendered resource set

    Note over Reconciler,Cluster: Server-Side Apply

    Reconciler->>PlatformUtils: Deploy rendered manifests
    PlatformUtils->>K8sAPI: SSA: MCPServer CRD<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io)
    K8sAPI-->>PlatformUtils: Applied
    PlatformUtils->>K8sAPI: SSA: ServiceAccount + RBAC
    K8sAPI-->>PlatformUtils: Applied
    PlatformUtils->>K8sAPI: SSA: mcp-lifecycle-operator Deployment
    K8sAPI-->>PlatformUtils: Applied
    PlatformUtils->>K8sAPI: SSA: Metrics Service (8443)
    K8sAPI-->>PlatformUtils: Applied
    PlatformUtils->>K8sAPI: SSA: ServiceMonitor
    K8sAPI-->>PlatformUtils: Applied
    PlatformUtils-->>Reconciler: Deployment complete

    Note over Reconciler: Condition Management

    Reconciler->>K8sAPI: Update MCPLifecycleOperator status<br/>conditions: Ready, Degraded,<br/>ProvisioningSucceeded
    K8sAPI-->>Reconciler: Status updated

    deactivate Reconciler

    Note over Reconciler,K8sAPI: Health Probe Flow (continuous)

    loop Kubernetes Probes
        K8sAPI->>Reconciler: GET /healthz (port 8081)
        Reconciler-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
        K8sAPI->>Reconciler: GET /readyz (port 8081)
        Reconciler-->>K8sAPI: 200 OK
    end
